                                                               ; THE TEMPORARY COMES HOME  sixteen bytes from @0x10 to
                                                               ; @0x1f moved down over the state at @0x00 to @0x0f
                                                               ; which pass one left empty; the pointer comes back
                                                               ; where it started;
