; ============================================================ ; the bit that fell off the WHOLE value is the
                                                               ; reduction
                                                               ; it is not tested; 0xe1 is multiplied by it  so the
                                                               ; exclusive or below runs against 0xe1 or against
                                                               ; nought and costs the same either way
>
  [->>>>>>
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
    +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
  <<<<<<]

